<title>UK: Meyer says gp finance director quits.</title>
<headline>Meyer says gp finance director quits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building materials and timber group Meyer International Plc said on Monday its group finance director Bruce Wright had resigned.</p>
<p>Meyer said it would make a statement on Wright's successor &quot;in due course&quot;.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
